  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_3c803f4a-9bc3-4cbf-b358-cff480ba360d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"358\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_ccd374e4-5080-4932-99a3-9d1cde9e3272.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"127\"></p><p>HyturCraft RPG 是一個<strong>基於 Fabric 的 RPG 模組包</strong>，專注於<strong>效能優化、任務系統、首領進度與法術引擎系統</strong>。由 GTD Produções YouTube 頻道打造，帶您深入一個<strong>被神秘宇宙實體侵蝕</strong>的中古世界——危險潛伏於每個陰影之中，唯有最強者得以存活。<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#e40000\">本模組包仍在持續開發中，誠摯歡迎錯誤回報與建議！</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_64c6466f-ebc7-485a-b21d-f20d7dc6a1e0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"127\"></p><p><strong>效能優化</strong> ⚡ - 精選效能強化模組，流暢遊戲體驗</p><p><strong>沉浸式任務系統</strong> 📜 - <strong>超過 200 個自訂任務</strong>引領您的冒險</p><p><strong>強化戰鬥機制</strong> ⚔️ - 動態近戰、遠程與魔法戰鬥系統</p><p><strong>法術引擎整合</strong> 🪄 - 從<strong>20多種獨特職業</strong>中選擇，每個職業皆具專屬法術與能力</p><p><strong>起源模組協同</strong> 🏹 - <strong>超過 1000 種組合可能</strong>塑造角色遊玩風格</p><p><strong>自訂技能樹</strong> 🌲 - 透過<strong>Simply Skills</strong>解鎖專屬能力，深化成長系統</p><p><strong>挑戰性首領進度</strong> 🏆 - 征服日益強大的敵人，證明自身價值</p><p><strong>擴展性世界生成</strong> 🌍 - 探索<strong>數百座建築、地下城與隱藏秘密</strong></p><p><strong>經濟與商店系統</strong> 💰 - 交易、購買與販售裝備，自訂專屬冒險</p><p><strong>自適應難度調節</strong> 🎚️ - 隨著角色成長，世界將變得更加危險</p><p><strong>演進式劇情設定</strong> 📖 - 逐步揭開<strong>宇宙腐化之謎</strong>，持續開發新故事線</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_4a315002-4c57-421e-8d2f-46169fe020be.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"127\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_3b887e45-205f-4029-8b03-5750f67ace36.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_081572b5-d096-4692-b7c2-90f5d5da1754.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_3aa0f2a7-6e92-40fb-a9f7-d2ceb9f19486.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_ec9ca0b7-c94a-48a1-9e0c-97c50bc6a082.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_f571595a-9632-4f25-b932-b68446a0bdc0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_c5712a1d-de06-4d2f-854d-0bc789ad8012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1227037/description_1af836e8-e4d0-484a-8882-e6038bebb8e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>",
